# Immortals setting things: set char (every field, each range, players against mobs), set skill (one and all), set
# obj (each value, and the fields that wrap into a short), set room (and a private room refused, at trust 58) and
# string (each field of a character and an object, and extra descriptions). stat, score and look show the results.
# In the temple (3001), with Hassan: Smokegod (60), Seraph (56) and Decimus (10). The C's small faults show here:
# strength's range ends ".", after its newline; hunger's range is called Full's; hours has no newline; and a spec
# that isn't one takes Hassan's away (#71).
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect ser
Seraph
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
